%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-strings-functions-substringby (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import substringBy from dw::core::Strings
output application/json
---
"hello~world=here_data-weave" substringBy $ == "~" or $ == "=" or $ == "_"
%%% output application/json
[
  "hello",
  "world",
  "here",
  "data-weave"
]
